<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

  <title>FileVora Blog — FileVora</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Explore FileVora guides, file-format tutorials, productivity tips and website updates."
  >

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tool-unified.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/filevora-header-tools.css">

  <style>
    .blog-content {
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .blog-intro {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto 30px;
      color: #475569;
      line-height: 1.75;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .blog-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 28px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .blog-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: #ffffff;
      transition:
        transform 0.2s ease,
        border-color 0.2s ease,
        box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .blog-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: #7dd3c7;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    }

    .blog-icon {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #99f6e4;
      border-radius: 13px;
      background: #ecfdf5;
      color: #009a73;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .blog-card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .blog-card p {
      flex: 1;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: #64748b;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .blog-status {
      color: #009a73;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .blog-action {
      margin-top: 34px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .blog-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <%- include("partials/tool-header") %>

  <main class="info-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">FILEVORA</div>

        <h1>FileVora Blog</h1>

        <p class="info-lead">
          Helpful guides, practical file tips and FileVora updates.
        </p>

        <div class="blog-content">
          <p class="blog-intro">
            The FileVora Blog is being prepared with simple tutorials and
            practical information to help you understand file formats, use
            online tools safely and complete everyday tasks more efficiently.
          </p>

          <div class="blog-grid">
            <article class="blog-card">
              <div class="blog-icon">IMG</div>

              <h2>Image Tool Guides</h2>

              <p>
                Learn how to resize, compress, crop and convert images while
                preserving the quality needed for websites and social media.
              </p>

              <span class="blog-status">Guides coming soon</span>
            </article>

            <article class="blog-card">
              <div class="blog-icon">PDF</div>

              <h2>PDF Tips</h2>

              <p>
                Discover useful ways to merge, split, compress and convert PDF
                documents for work, study and everyday file management.
              </p>

              <span class="blog-status">Guides coming soon</span>
            </article>

            <article class="blog-card">
              <div class="blog-icon">DEV</div>

              <h2>Developer Resources</h2>

              <p>
                Explore easy explanations and examples for JSON, Base64, URLs,
                CSV files, code formatting and other developer utilities.
              </p>

              <span class="blog-status">Resources coming soon</span>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="blog-action">
            <a class="hero-button" href="/#tools">Explore tools →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
          <span class="brand-mark">F</span>
          <span class="brand-name">File<span>Vora</span></span>
        </a>

        <p>Fast, simple online tools for everyday file tasks.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Company</h3>
        <a href="/about">About Us</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a>
        <a href="/security">Security</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Resources</h3>
        <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
        <a href="/#tools">Tools</a>
        <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Legal</h3>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Contact</h3>

        <a
          href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=filevora5%40gmail.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Email
        </a>

        <a href="/contact">Facebook</a>
        <a href="/contact">Instagram</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container footer-bottom">
      <span>
        © <span data-current-year></span> FileVora. All rights reserved.
      </span>

      <span>All in One Tool.</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document
      .querySelectorAll("[data-current-year]")
      .forEach((element) => {
        element.textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
      });
  </script>

  <script src="/js/filevora-tools.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/filevora-header-tools.js"></script>
</body>
</html>